    "objetivo": "Form the passato prossimo of verbs that take «essere»: movement, change of state and reflexive verbs. Make the participle agree with the subject and place «già», «non… ancora», «mai» and «appena». Avoid the English-speaker traps: one helper for every verb, no agreement, and dropping the reflexive pronoun.",
